54.247" end="2:56.226">na a</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><songwriters><songwriter>DECO*27</songwriter><songwriter>Rockwell</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="3:17.146"><div begin="3.449" end="3:17.146"><p begin="3.449" end="5.637" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.449" end="3.596">バ</span><span begin="3.596" end="3.741">ト</span><span begin="3.741" end="3.929">ン</span><span begin="3.929" end="4.055">に</span><span begin="4.055" end="4.271">つ</span><span begin="4.271" end="4.411">い</span><span begin="4.411" end="4.509">た</span><span begin="4.509" end="4.875" amll:empty-beat="1">砂</span><span begin="4.875" end="5.206" amll:empty-beat="1">払</span><span begin="5.206" end="5.354">っ</span><span begin="5.354" end="5.555">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">拂去接力棒上沉积的沙土 / Found a torch on the dune and brushed away the sand</span></p><p begin="5.637" end="7.335" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.637" end="6.010" amll:empty-beat="1">次</span><span begin="6.010" end="6.131">に</span><span begin="6.131" end="6.499" amll:empty-beat="1">深</span><span begin="6.499" end="6.638">呼</span><span begin="6.638" end="6.868" amll:empty-beat="1">吸</span><span begin="6.868" end="7.138">し</span><span begin="7.138" end="7.335">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">做一个深呼吸 / Then took a deep breath</span></p><p begin="8.149" end="11.138" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.149" end="8.320">そ</span><span begin="8.320" end="8.585">ん</span><span begin="8.585" end="8.758">で</span><span begin="8.758" end="8.941">名</span><span begin="8.941" end="9.077">も</span><span begin="9.077" end="9.290">な</span><span begin="9.290" end="9.426">い</span><span begin="9.426" end="9.586" amll:empty-beat="1">種</span><span begin="9.586" end="9.890">を</span><span begin="9.890" end="10.027">蒔</span><span begin="10.027" end="10.202">き</span><span begin="10.202" end="10.408">ま</span><span begin="10.408" end="10.539">し</span><span begin="10.539" end="10.869">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">播下了一颗无名的种子 / Planted a nameless seed</span></p><p begin="11.138" end="13.349" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.138" end="11.342">希</span><span begin="11.342" end="11.612" amll:empty-beat="1">望</span><span begin="11.612" end="11.806">を</span><span begin="11.806" end="11.970">ジョ</span><span begin="11.970" end="12.129">ウ</span><span begin="12.129" end="12.289">ロ</span><span begin="12.289" end="12.458">に</span><span begin="12.458" end="12.639">溜</span><span begin="12.639" end="12.799">め</span><span begin="12.799" end="13.004">ま</span><span begin="13.004" end="13.124">し</span><span begin="13.124" end="13.349">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">又将希望积存在浇灌的水壶中 / Took a watering can and filled it to the brim with hope</span></p><p begin="13.755" end="16.010" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.755" end="14.154" amll:empty-beat="1">歌</span><span begin="14.154" end="14.241">い</span><span begin="14.241" end="14.588" amll:empty-beat="1">疲</span><span begin="14.588" end="14.742">れ</span><span begin="14.742" end="14.891">た</span><span begin="14.891" end="15.052">な</span><span begin="15.052" end="15.199">ら</span><span begin="15.199" end="15.527" amll:empty-beat="1">休</span><span begin="15.527" end="15.686">ん</span><span begin="15.686" end="15.930">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">唱歌唱到疲倦了就休息吧 / If you&apos;re tired of singing then why don&apos;t you rest?</span></p><p begin="16.010" end="17.709" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.010" end="16.328" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="16.328" end="16.491">は</span><span begin="16.491" end="16.705">書</span><span begin="16.705" end="16.818">い</span><span begin="16.818" end="16.987">て</span><span begin="16.987" end="17.299">る</span><span begin="17.299" end="17.448">か</span><span begin="17.448" end="17.709">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我还会为你书写的 / I&apos;ll be jotting down some lines</span></p><p begin="18.609" end="21.468" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.609" end="18.768">な</span><span begin="18.768" end="18.909">ん</span><span begin="18.909" end="19.046">か</span><span begin="19.046" end="19.379" amll:empty-beat="1">想</span><span begin="19.379" end="19.722" amll:empty-beat="1">像</span><span begin="19.722" end="19.881">以</span><span begin="19.881" end="20.197" amll:empty-beat="1">上</span><span begin="20.197" end="20.367">に</span><span begin="20.367" end="20.517">な</span><span begin="20.517" end="20.574">っ</span><span begin="20.574" end="20.854">ちゃっ</span><span begin="20.854" end="21.200">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">总感觉这一切已然超出想象 / It somehow went far beyond our wildest dreams</span></p><p begin="21.468" end="24.298" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.468" end="21.825" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="21.825" end="21.985">が</span><span begin="21.985" end="22.162">泣</span><span begin="22.162" end="22.312">い</span><span begin="22.312" end="22.477">て</span><span begin="22.477" end="22.629">た</span><span begin="22.629" end="22.962" amll:empty-beat="1">頃</span><span begin="22.962" end="23.111">が</span><span begin="23.111" end="23.446" amll:empty-beat="1">懐</span><span begin="23.446" end="23.557">か</span><span begin="23.557" end="23.777">し</span><span begin="23.777" end="23.934">い</span><span begin="23.934" end="24.298">や</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">真怀念你当初哭泣的时候啊 / Do you remember the days when you used to cry?</span></p><p begin="24.868" end="28.420" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.868" end="25.017">ず</span><span begin="25.017" end="25.200">っ</span><span begin="25.200" end="25.366">と</span> <span begin="25.366" end="25.679" amll:empty-beat="1">何</span><span begin="25.679" end="26.033" amll:empty-beat="1">回</span><span begin="26.033" end="26.183">だ</span><span begin="26.183" end="26.335">っ</span><span begin="26.335" end="26.501">て</span><span begin="26.501" end="27.081" amll:empty-beat="1">思</span><span begin="27.081" end="27.158">い</span><span begin="27.158" end="27.244">出</span><span begin="27.244" end="27.629">し</span><span begin="27.629" end="27.778">て</span><span begin="27.778" end="27.907">ほ</span><span begin="27.907" end="28.126">し</span><span begin="28.126" end="28.280">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一直以来 无数次希望你能够回想起来 / Again and again, I don&apos;t ever want you to forget</span></p><p begin="28.420" end="31.825" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.420" end="29.089" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="29.089" end="29.367">は</span><span begin="29.367" end="29.566">ひ</span><span begin="29.566" end="29.742">と</span><span begin="29.742" end="29.896">り</span><span begin="29.896" end="30.037">に</span><span begin="30.037" end="30.208">な</span><span begin="30.208" end="30.369">ん</span><span begin="30.369" end="30.537">か</span><span begin="30.537" end="30.696">な</span><span begin="30.696" end="30.835">れ</span><span begin="30.835" end="30.954">や</span><span begin="30.954" end="31.178">し</span><span begin="31.178" end="31.338">な</span><span begin="31.338" end="31.465">い</span><span begin="31.465" end="31.701">し</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我绝不会让你孤身一人 / There&apos;s no way no how you&apos;ll ever be alone</span></p><p begin="31.825" end="34.600" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.825" end="32.149" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="32.149" end="32.309">は</span><span begin="32.309" end="32.443">い</span><span begin="32.443" end="32.639">つ</span><span begin="32.639" end="32.794">ま</span><span begin="32.794" end="32.954">で</span><span begin="32.954" end="33.111">も</span><span begin="33.111" end="33.453" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="33.453" end="33.612">の</span><span begin="33.612" end="34.100" amll:empty-beat="1">隣</span><span begin="34.100" end="34.259">に</span><span begin="34.259" end="34.386">い</span><span begin="34.386" end="34.600">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">无论何时都会陪伴在你身边 / And I&apos;m always going to be by your side</span></p><p begin="36.178" end="37.618" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.178" end="36.654" amll:empty-beat="1">響</span><span begin="36.654" end="36.817">け</span><span begin="36.817" end="37.129">オゥ</span><span begin="37.129" end="37.467">イェイ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让我们高喊 Oh Yeah / The resounding &quot;Oh yeah!&quot;</span></p><p begin="37.618" end="39.581" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.618" end="37.959" amll:empty-beat="1">廻</span><span begin="37.959" end="38.118">り</span><span begin="38.118" end="38.278">出</span><span begin="38.278" end="38.438">す</span><span begin="38.438" end="38.559">ブ</span><span begin="38.559" end="38.723">ルー</span><span begin="38.723" end="38.770">プ</span><span begin="38.770" end="38.937">ラ</span><span begin="38.937" end="39.254">ネッ</span><span begin="39.254" end="39.414">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">开始旋转的蔚蓝星球 / The turning of this BLUE PLANET</span></p><p begin="39.581" end="41.818" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.581" end="39.738">も</span><span begin="39.738" end="39.868">う</span><span begin="39.868" end="40.022">突</span><span begin="40.022" end="40.140">き</span><span begin="40.140" end="40.527" amll:empty-beat="1">進</span><span begin="40.527" end="40.685">む</span><span begin="40.685" end="40.854">だ</span><span begin="40.854" end="40.964">け</span><span begin="40.964" end="41.069">サ</span><span begin="41.069" end="41.178">ン</span><span begin="41.178" end="41.383">ゴー</span><span begin="41.383" end="41.485">ズ</span><span begin="41.485" end="41.587">ア</span><span begin="41.587" end="41.657">ッ</span><span begin="41.657" end="41.818">プ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在这朝阳升起之时 唯有奋勇前进 / We&apos;ve got to forge ahead, charge on, the sun goes up</span></p><p begin="41.861" end="44.069" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.861" end="42.128">そ</span><span begin="42.128" end="42.205">う</span><span begin="42.205" end="42.551">さ</span><span begin="42.797" end="42.968">上</span><span begin="42.968" end="43.068">げ</span><span begin="43.068" end="43.282">下</span><span begin="43.282" end="43.393">げ</span><span begin="43.393" end="43.608">し</span><span begin="43.608" end="43.768">た</span><span begin="43.768" end="43.928">っ</span><span begin="43.928" end="44.069">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">是啊 无论历经多少起起落落 / That&apos;s right, up or down</span></p><p begin="44.069" end="46.858" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.069" end="44.255">ど</span><span begin="44.255" end="44.331">う</span><span begin="44.331" end="44.586">せ</span><span begin="44.586" end="45.074" amll:empty-beat="1">最</span><span begin="45.074" end="45.206">後</span><span begin="45.206" end="45.327">に</span><span begin="45.327" end="45.677" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="45.677" end="45.851">ら</span><span begin="45.851" end="46.011">は</span><span begin="46.011" end="46.338" amll:empty-beat="1">笑</span><span begin="46.338" end="46.498">う</span><span begin="46.498" end="46.657">ん</span><span begin="46.657" end="46.858">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">最终我们一定会笑着迎来结局 / Either way, we&apos;ll end up grinning from ear to ear</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="47.147" end="49.559"><span begin="47.147" end="47.472">(ま</span><span begin="47.472" end="47.968">だ</span><span begin="47.968" end="48.122">い</span><span begin="48.122" end="48.606">け</span><span begin="48.606" end="48.775">る</span><span begin="48.775" end="49.309">か)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">还可以继续吧 / We can keep going</span></span></p><p begin="49.559" end="51.982" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.559" end="49.689">き</span><span begin="49.689" end="49.895">っ</span><span begin="49.895" end="50.036">と</span><span begin="50.036" end="50.198">ま</span><span begin="50.198" end="50.368">だ</span><span begin="50.368" end="50.524">ま</span><span begin="50.524" end="50.684">だ</span><span begin="50.684" end="50.860">見</span><span begin="50.860" end="51.012">え</span><span begin="51.012" end="51.162">な</span><span begin="51.162" end="51.255">い</span><span begin="51.255" end="51.572" amll:empty-beat="1">最</span><span begin="51.572" end="51.799" amll:empty-beat="1">前</span><span begin="51.799" end="51.982" amll:empty-beat="1">線</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">最前线肯定还远在看不见的前方 / The frontier is still too far away to see</span></p><p begin="52.137" end="53.439" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.137" end="52.309">「過</span><span begin="52.309" end="52.469">去</span><span begin="52.469" end="52.646">は」</span><span begin="52.802" end="53.098" amll:empty-beat="1">「今</span><span begin="53.098" end="53.266">は」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“过去如何”“现在如何” / What about the PAST? And NOW?</span></p><p begin="53.439" end="55.974" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.439" end="53.611">う</span><span begin="53.611" end="53.769">る</span><span begin="53.769" end="53.931">せ</span><span begin="53.931" end="54.099">え</span><span begin="54.099" end="54.738" amll:empty-beat="1">関</span><span begin="54.738" end="55.038" amll:empty-beat="1">係</span><span begin="55.038" end="55.203">ね</span><span begin="55.203" end="55.698">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">跟我们又有何关系 / Shut up, doesn’t matter</span></p><p begin="55.974" end="1:00.080" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.974" end="56.332" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="56.332" end="56.422">が</span><span begin="56.422" end="56.742" amll:empty-beat="1">最</span><span begin="56.742" end="56.979" amll:empty-beat="1">上</span><span begin="56.979" end="57.311" amll:empty-beat="1">級</span><span begin="57.311" end="57.631">の</span><span begin="57.631" end="57.961">パー</span><span begin="57.961" end="58.121">ト</span><span begin="58.121" end="1:00.080">ナー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你就是最高级的伙伴啊 /You&apos;ll always be my one and only partner</span></p><p begin="1:00.693" end="1:10.520" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.693" end="1:01.017">Woah-</span><span begin="1:01.017" end="1:01.660">oh-</span><span begin="1:01.660" end="1:02.237">oh-</span><span begin="1:02.237" end="1:02.920">oh</span> <span begin="1:03.284" end="1:03.614">Woah-</span><span begin="1:03.614" end="1:04.255">oh-</span><span begin="1:04.255" end="1:04.906">oh-</span><span begin="1:04.906" end="1:05.399">oh</span> <span begin="1:05.852" end="1:06.136">Woah-</span><span begin="1:06.136" end="1:06.815">oh-</span><span begin="1:06.815" end="1:07.634">oh-</span><span begin="1:07.634" end="1:08.114">oh</span> <span begin="1:08.438" end="1:08.757">Woah-</span><span begin="1:08.757" end="1:09.258">oh-</span><span begin="1:09.258" end="1:09.949">yeah-</span><span begin="1:09.949" end="1:10.520">yeah</span></p><p begin="1:10.520" end="1:12.797" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.520" end="1:10.683">可</span><span begin="1:10.683" end="1:10.926" amll:empty-beat="1">能</span><span begin="1:10.926" end="1:11.271">性</span><span begin="1:11.271" end="1:11.495">ふ</span><span begin="1:11.495" end="1:11.661">た</span><span begin="1:11.661" end="1:11.815">り</span><span begin="1:11.815" end="1:11.939">で</span><span begin="1:11.939" end="1:12.153">背</span><span begin="1:12.153" end="1:12.302">負</span><span begin="1:12.302" end="1:12.469">っ</span><span begin="1:12.469" end="1:12.680">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">共同背负着可能性的我们 / The two of us, with both our hopes in the palms of our hands</span></p><p begin="1:12.797" end="1:14.629" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.797" end="1:12.926">立</span><span begin="1:12.926" end="1:13.117">ち</span><span begin="1:13.117" end="1:13.280">止</span><span begin="1:13.280" end="1:13.583">ま</span><span begin="1:13.583" end="1:13.769">ら</span><span begin="1:13.769" end="1:13.992">な</span><span begin="1:13.992" end="1:14.106">い</span><span begin="1:14.106" end="1:14.254">ま</span><span begin="1:14.254" end="1:14.629">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">哪有时间停滞不前 / Never taking time to slow down</span></p><p begin="1:15.324" end="1:18.119" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.324" end="1:15.682">ちょっ</span><span begin="1:15.682" end="1:15.860">と</span><span begin="1:15.860" end="1:16.178" amll:empty-beat="1">今</span><span begin="1:16.178" end="1:16.343">ま</span><span begin="1:16.343" end="1:16.483">で</span><span begin="1:16.483" end="1:16.699">やっ</span><span begin="1:16.814" end="1:16.994">て</span><span begin="1:16.994" end="1:17.147">こ</span><span begin="1:17.147" end="1:17.347">な</span><span begin="1:17.347" end="1:17.475">か</span><span begin="1:17.475" end="1:17.618">っ</span><span begin="1:17.618" end="1:17.898">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">要不要一起来聊一聊回忆呢 / Why don’t we try doing something new</span></p><p begin="1:18.119" end="1:20.989" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.119" end="1:18.444" amll:empty-beat="1">思</span><span begin="1:18.444" end="1:18.615">い</span><span begin="1:18.615" end="1:18.768">出</span><span begin="1:18.768" end="1:19.251" amll:empty-beat="2">話</span><span begin="1:19.251" end="1:19.361">の</span><span begin="1:19.361" end="1:19.572">ひ</span><span begin="1:19.572" end="1:19.703">と</span><span begin="1:19.703" end="1:19.896">つ</span><span begin="1:19.896" end="1:20.045">で</span><span begin="1:20.045" end="1:20.141">も</span><span begin="1:20.141" end="1:20.367">し</span><span begin="1:20.367" end="1:20.582">よ</span><span begin="1:20.582" end="1:20.689">う</span><span begin="1:20.689" end="1:20.989">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">毕竟以前都从来没有聊过 / And reminisce about this or that</span></p><p begin="1:21.586" end="1:25.184" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.586" end="1:21.821">や</span><span begin="1:21.821" end="1:21.975">っ</span><span begin="1:21.975" end="1:22.128">ぱ</span><span begin="1:22.128" end="1:22.388" amll:empty-beat="1">挑</span><span begin="1:22.388" end="1:22.805" amll:empty-beat="1">戦</span><span begin="1:22.805" end="1:22.936">な</span><span begin="1:22.936" end="1:23.110">し</span><span begin="1:23.110" end="1:23.328">じゃ</span><span begin="1:23.328" end="1:23.442">す</span><span begin="1:23.442" end="1:23.673">げ</span><span begin="1:23.673" end="1:23.889">ー</span><span begin="1:23.889" end="1:24.092">つ</span><span begin="1:24.092" end="1:24.266">ま</span><span begin="1:24.266" end="1:24.419">ん</span><span begin="1:24.419" end="1:24.566">な</span><span begin="1:24.566" end="1:24.721">い</span><span begin="1:24.721" end="1:24.961">じゃ</span><span begin="1:24.961" end="1:25.082">ん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">果然如果没有挑战的话 那就实在太无聊了 / See? Life’s boring without a challenge</span></p><p begin="1:25.184" end="1:28.606" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:25.184" end="1:25.854" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="1:25.854" end="1:26.169">の</span><span begin="1:26.169" end="1:26.340">見</span><span begin="1:26.340" end="1:26.489">た</span><span begin="1:26.489" end="1:26.658">こ</span><span begin="1:26.658" end="1:26.830">と</span><span begin="1:26.830" end="1:26.993">な</span><span begin="1:26.993" end="1:27.149">い</span><span begin="1:27.149" end="1:27.327">と</span><span begin="1:27.327" end="1:27.472">こ</span><span begin="1:27.472" end="1:27.632">が</span><span begin="1:27.632" end="1:27.787">見</span><span begin="1:27.787" end="1:27.939">た</span><span begin="1:27.939" end="1:28.090">い</span><span begin="1:28.090" end="1:28.258">ん</span><span begin="1:28.258" end="1:28.458">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我想看到一个全新的你啊 / I want to see a whole new facet of you</span></p><p begin="1:28.606" end="1:31.770" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.606" end="1:28.938" amll:empty-beat="1">一</span><span begin="1:28.938" end="1:29.250" amll:empty-beat="1">番</span><span begin="1:29.250" end="1:29.410">に</span><span begin="1:29.410" end="1:29.881" amll:empty-beat="2">輝</span><span begin="1:29.881" end="1:30.039">く</span><span begin="1:30.039" end="1:30.361" amll:empty-beat="1">星</span><span begin="1:30.361" end="1:30.521">で</span><span begin="1:30.521" end="1:30.658">あ</span><span begin="1:30.658" end="1:30.844">っ</span><span begin="1:30.844" end="1:31.004">て</span><span begin="1:31.004" end="1:31.130">く</span><span begin="1:31.130" end="1:31.770">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">请你一定要成为最闪耀的那颗星 / Please stay the brightest burning star in the sky</span></p><p begin="1:33.011" end="1:34.378" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.011" end="1:33.437" amll:empty-beat="1">響</span><span begin="1:33.437" end="1:33.586">け</span><span begin="1:33.586" end="1:33.922">オゥ</span><span begin="1:33.922" end="1:34.202">イェイ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让我们高喊 Oh Yeah / The resounding &quot;Oh yeah!&quot;</span></p><p begin="1:34.378" end="1:36.490" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.378" end="1:34.742" amll:empty-beat="1">廻</span><span begin="1:34.742" end="1:34.910">り</span><span begin="1:34.910" end="1:35.010">出</span><span begin="1:35.010" end="1:35.170">す</span><span begin="1:35.170" end="1:35.207">ブ</span><span begin="1:35.207" end="1:35.448">ルー</span><span begin="1:35.448" end="1:35.527">プ</span><span begin="1:35.527" end="1:35.657">ラ</span><span begin="1:35.657" end="1:35.853">ネ</span><span begin="1:35.853" end="1:36.000">ッ</span><span begin="1:36.000" end="1:36.345">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">开始旋转的蔚蓝星球 / The turning of this BLUE PLANET</span></p><p begin="1:36.490" end="1:38.518" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:36.490" end="1:36.588">ど</span><span begin="1:36.588" end="1:36.654">ん</span><span begin="1:36.654" end="1:36.821">だ</span><span begin="1:36.821" end="1:36.978">け</span><span begin="1:36.978" end="1:37.307" amll:empty-beat="1">叶</span><span begin="1:37.307" end="1:37.466">え</span><span begin="1:37.466" end="1:37.633">て</span><span begin="1:37.633" end="1:37.796">も</span><span begin="1:37.796" end="1:37.993">終</span><span begin="1:37.993" end="1:38.114">わ</span><span begin="1:38.114" end="1:38.271">ん</span><span begin="1:38.271" end="1:38.397">な</span><span begin="1:38.397" end="1:38.518">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">无论实现多少梦想都不会止步 / We can never have enough victories</span></p><p begin="1:38.607" end="1:40.195" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:38.607" end="1:38.773">時</span><span begin="1:38.773" end="1:39.093" amll:empty-beat="1">効</span><span begin="1:39.093" end="1:39.578">は</span><span begin="1:39.578" end="1:39.720">来</span><span begin="1:39.720" end="1:39.869">な</span><span begin="1:39.869" end="1:40.058">い</span><span begin="1:40.058" end="1:40.195">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我们绝不会满足 / We&apos;ll never be satisfied</span></p><p begin="1:40.195" end="1:43.622" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.195" end="1:40.367">起</span><span begin="1:40.367" end="1:40.595">こ</span><span begin="1:40.595" end="1:40.824">し</span><span begin="1:40.824" end="1:40.942">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:40.942" end="1:41.178">っ</span><span begin="1:41.178" end="1:41.333">た</span><span begin="1:41.333" end="1:41.668" amll:empty-beat="1">願</span><span begin="1:41.668" end="1:41.835">い</span><span begin="1:41.835" end="1:41.993">が</span><span begin="1:41.993" end="1:42.305" amll:empty-beat="1">僕</span><span begin="1:42.305" end="1:42.465">ら</span><span begin="1:42.465" end="1:42.718">許</span><span begin="1:42.718" end="1:42.963">さ</span><span begin="1:42.963" end="1:43.098">な</span><span begin="1:43.098" end="1:43.281">い</span><span begin="1:43.281" end="1:43.454">ん</span><span begin="1:43.454" end="1:43.622">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让我们觉醒的希望不会允许我们退出 / The hope we woke up won&apos;t let us quit</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:43.933" end="1:46.090"><span begin="1:43.933" end="1:44.260">(ま</span><span begin="1:44.260" end="1:44.739">だ</span><span begin="1:44.739" end="1:44.905">い</span><span begin="1:44.905" end="1:45.380">け</span><span begin="1:45.380" end="1:45.524">る</span><span begin="1:45.524" end="1:46.090">か)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">还可以继续吧 / We can keep going</span></span></p><p begin="1:46.309" end="1:48.869" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.309" end="1:46.429">き</span><span begin="1:46.429" end="1:46.640">っ</span><span begin="1:46.640" end="1:46.818">と</span><span begin="1:46.818" end="1:46.978">ま</span><span begin="1:46.978" end="1:47.160">だ</span><span begin="1:47.160" end="1:47.312">ま</span><span begin="1:47.312" end="1:47.472">だ</span><span begin="1:47.472" end="1:47.623">見</span><span begin="1:47.623" end="1:47.796">え</span><span begin="1:47.796" end="1:47.983">な</span><span begin="1:47.983" end="1:48.051">い</span><span begin="1:48.051" end="1:48.351" amll:empty-beat="1">最</span><span begin="1:48.351" end="1:48.592" amll:empty-beat="1">前</span><span begin="1:48.592" end="1:48.869" amll:empty-beat="1">線</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">最前线肯定还远在看不见的前方 / The frontier is still too far away to see</span></p><p begin="1:48.917" end="1:50.203" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.917" end="1:49.093">「過</span><span begin="1:49.093" end="1:49.247">去</span><span begin="1:49.247" end="1:49.434">は」</span><span begin="1:49.577" end="1:49.897" amll:empty-beat="1">「今</span><span begin="1:49.897" end="1:50.080">は」</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">“过去如何”“现在如何” / What about the PAST? And NOW?</span></p><p begin="1:50.203" end="1:52.767" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.203" end="1:50.370">う</span><span begin="1:50.370" end="1:50.479">る</span><span begin="1:50.479" end="1:50.640">せ</span><span begin="1:50.640" end="1:50.783">え</span><span begin="1:51.140" end="1:51.498" amll:empty-beat="1">関</span><span begin="1:51.498" end="1:51.808" amll:empty-beat="1">係</span><span begin="1:51.808" end="1:51.989">ね</span><span begin="1:51.989" end="1:52.378">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">跟我们又有何关系 / Shut up, doesn&apos;t matter</span></p><p begin="1:52.767" end="1:55.738" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.767" end="1:53.124" amll:empty-beat="1">君</span><span begin="1:53.124" end="1:53.287">が</span><span begin="1:53.287" end="1:53.521" amll:empty-beat="1">最</span><span begin="1:53.521" end="1:53.758" amll:empty-beat="1">上</span><span begin="1:53.758" end="1:54.094" amll:empty-beat="1">級</span><span begin="1:54.094" end="1:54.394">の</span><span begin="1:54.394" end="1:54.741">パー</span><span begin="1:54.741" end="1:54.898">ト</span><span begin="1:54.898" end="1:55.738">ナー</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你就是最高级的伙伴啊 / You’ll always be my one and only partner</span></p><p begin="1:56.181" end="1:59.579" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.181" end="1:56.805" amll:empty-beat="1">誰</span><span begin="1:56.805" end="1:57.143">か</span><span begin="1:57.143" end="1:57.472">の</span><span begin="1:57.472" end="1:57.942" amll:empty-beat="1">夢</span><span begin="1:57.942" end="1:58.282">に</span><span begin="1:58.282" end="1:58.426">な</span><span begin="1:58.426" end="1:58.604">っ</span><span begin="1:58.604" end="1:58.710">た</span><span begin="1:58.710" end="1:59.280">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">若是成为了某人的梦想 / When you became a becon for so many</span></p><p begin="1:59.579" end="2:02.127" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:59.579" end="2:00.204" amll:empty-beat="2">失</span><span begin="2:00.204" end="2:00.347">う</span><span begin="2:00.347" end="2:00.507">も</span><span begin="2:00.507" end="2:00.691">の</span><span begin="2:00.691" end="2:00.821">も</span><span begin="2:00.821" end="2:01.023">増</span><span begin="2:01.023" end="2:01.165">え</span><span begin="2:01.165" end="2:01.332">た</span><span begin="2:01.332" end="2:01.505">だ</span><span begin="2:01.505" end="2:01.660">ろ</span><span begin="2:01.660" end="2:01.810">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">失去的东西一定会更多吧 / You must have given up so much</span></p><p begin="2:02.127" end="2:04.338" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.127" end="2:02.505" amll:empty-beat="1">隠</span><span begin="2:02.505" end="2:02.798">し</span><span begin="2:02.798" end="2:02.958">た</span><span begin="2:02.958" end="2:03.446" amll:empty-beat="2">涙</span><span begin="2:03.446" end="2:03.605">も</span><span begin="2:03.605" end="2:03.770">あ</span><span begin="2:03.770" end="2:03.931">る</span><span begin="2:03.931" end="2:04.076">だ</span><span begin="2:04.076" end="2:04.236">ろ</span><span begin="2:04.236" end="2:04.338">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">也一定会偷偷流眼泪吧 / Shed some tears you never showed</span></p><p begin="2:06.020" end="2:08.438" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:06.020" end="2:06.180">も</span><span begin="2:06.180" end="2:06.329">う</span><span begin="2:06.329" end="2:06.660" amll:empty-beat="1">限</span><span begin="2:06.660" end="2:06.978" amll:empty-beat="1">界</span><span begin="2:06.978" end="2:07.128">と</span><span begin="2:07.128" end="2:07.829">か</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">但是请不要说 / You&apos;re so remarkable</span></p><p begin="2:08.438" end="2:10.008" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:08.438" end="2:08.610">言</span><span begin="2:08.610" end="2:08.934">わ</span><span begin="2:08.934" end="2:09.238">な</span><span begin="2:09.238" end="2:09.479">い</span><span begin="2:09.479" end="2:09.581">ん</span><span begin="2:09.581" end="2:09.742">だ</span><span begin="2:09.742" end="2:10.008">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">已经不行了这种话 / You don&apos;t ever say, &quot;I can&apos;t&quot;</span></p><p begin="2:10.694" end="2:15.198" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.694" end="2:10.808">も</span><span begin="2:10.808" end="2:11.027">う</span><span begin="2:11.341" end="2:11.657" amll:empty-beat="1">一</span><span begin="2:11.988" end="2:12.299">歩</span><span begin="2:12.366" end="2:12.792" amll:empty-beat="1">進</span><span begin="2:12.792" end="2:12.960">め</span><span begin="2:12.960" end="2:13.120">る</span><span begin="2:13.120" end="2:13.288">か</span><span begin="2:13.288" end="2:13.446">も</span><span begin="2:13.446" end="2:13.606">で</span><span begin="2:13.606" end="2:14.103" amll:empty-beat="2">心</span><span begin="2:14.103" end="2:14.423" amll:empty-beat="1">躍</span><span begin="2:14.423" end="2:14.576">っ</span><span begin="2:14.576" end="2:14.701">て</span><span begin="2:14.701" end="2:14.918">ん</span><span begin="2:14.918" end="2:15.018">の</span><span begin="2:15.018" end="2:15.198">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为你的内心一直都在为了新的一步而跃动啊 / Cuz your heart’s always dancing to the beat of the next possibility</span></p><p begin="2:16.875" end="2:18.280" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:16.875" end="2:17.312" amll:empty-beat="1">響</span><span begin="2:17.312" end="2:17.520">け</span><span begin="2:17.520" end="2:17.832">オゥ</span><span begin="2:17.832" end="2:18.106">イェイ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">让我们高喊 Oh Yeah / The resounding “Oh yeah!”</span></p><p begin="2:18.280" end="2:20.197" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.280" end="2:18.595" amll:empty-beat="1">廻</span><span begin="2:18.595" end="2:18.765">り</span><span begin="2:18.765" end="2:18.917">出</span><span begin="2:18.917" end="2:19.040">す</span><span begin="2:19.040" end="2:19.106">ブ</span><span begin="2:19.106" end="2:19.359">ルー</span><span begin="2:19.359" end="2:19.421">プ</span><span begin="2:19.421" end="2:19.574">ラ</span><span begin="2:19.574" end="2:19.746">ネ</span><span begin="2:19.746" end="2:19.902">ッ</span><span begin="2:19.902" end="2:20.040">ト</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">开始旋转的蔚蓝星球 / The turning of this BLUE PLANET</span></p><p begin="2:20.197" end="2:22.408" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:20.197" end="2:20.335">も</span><span begin="2:20.335" end="2:20.485">う</span><span begin="2:20.485" end="2:20.679">突</span><span begin="2:20.679" end="2:20.799">き</span><span begin="2:20.799" end="2:21.169" amll:empty-beat="1">進</span><span begin="2:21.169" end="2:21.339">む</span><span begin="2:21.339" end="2:21.476">だ</span><span begin="2:21.476" end="2:21.657">け</span><spa